hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1227","Bishr bin Muadh Al-Aqdi told us, on the authority of Yazid, meaning Ibn Zuray’, on the authority of Sa’id, on the authority of Qatada, on the authority of Al-Qasim bin Awf Al-Shaybani, on the authority of Zaid. Ibn Arqam, that the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, went out to a people while they were praying the noon prayer in the Quba Mosque when the sun rose, and the Messenger of God said: God, may God bless him and grant him peace: “The prayer of those who return to prayer when the seasons turn gray.” Bishr bin Muadh told us, Hammad bin Zaid told us, Ayoub told us, on the authority of Al-Qasim bin Awf Al-Shaybani, on the authority of Zayd bin Arqam, on the authority of the Prophet May God bless him and grant him peace: something similar"
